# The boss under the block of testdata/topo/boss.tlspr: the circle at its
# foot, which the Boolean made and no entity draws, is one edge of four
# pieces. The mouse picks it on a piece whose name is not the lowest,
# and the fillet names the edge by its lowest piece all the same; the
# same as path_fillet_rim.go makes (TestPathEquivalenceFilletRim).
file $testdata/topo/boss.tlspr
menu File|Open...
view rotated
menu View|Zoom To Fit
move 337 277
down L 337 277
up L 337 277
menu New Group|Fillet Edges
